<mxCell id="b5" value="5" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;aspect=fixed;fillColor=#0288D1;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1330" y="55" width="36" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="b6" value="6" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;aspect=fixed;fillColor=#F4B400;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1840" y="180" width="36" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="b7" value="7" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;aspect=fixed;fillColor=#00897B;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1120" y="420" width="36" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="b8" value="8" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;aspect=fixed;fillColor=#00897B;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1300" y="30" width="36" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="note" value="&lt;b&gt;Why no second authentication, but still an authorisation check:&lt;/b&gt; users are SAML-authenticated to Looker by Entra, so Looker&#39;s user attributes (entra_oid, upn, groups) are Entra-asserted identity — the action already carries a trustworthy &lt;i&gt;who&lt;/i&gt;. The Entra bearer token itself is never forwarded by Looker, so it cannot be re-validated; nor does it need to be. What must still be checked at write time is &lt;i&gt;may this user write to this dataset right now&lt;/i&gt;: a live Microsoft Graph lookup confirms the account is enabled and still in the BQ-Writeback-&lt;dataset&gt; group (protects against offboarding / group removal during a long Looker session), cached 5 min, fail-closed. Apigee and ID&amp;A are not on the path — the Write-back API calls Graph directly with its own app registration (client credentials, GroupMember.Read.All, User.Read.All).&#10;&lt;b&gt;Controls kept:&lt;/b&gt; Looker HMAC (it is our Looker) → entra_oid required (SAML-asserted identity) → Graph group check (authorised now) → dataset policy (this target) → Writer accepts only the gatekeeper SA (no bypass) → tenant-scoped writer SA → append-only log + audit with entra_oid." style="text;html=1;fontSize=12;align=left;spacing=10;fillColor=#FDECEA;strokeColor=#EA4335;rounded=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="660" width="2060" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
</root></mxGraphModel></diagram>
</mxfile>